# The SHA256 of each picture, MEL and dump file that the runs of the suite write (run-fel.sh, stage outputs).
# The .pics and dump files have not changed since the module's commit that kept a queued access unit of the layer in
# one entry. The .out files of mel_test hash, for each picture, the metadata FFmpeg parsed (AV_FRAME_DATA_DOVI_METADATA)
# as FFmpeg lays it out in memory: these are of the FFmpeg of the recipe, whose libavutil/dovi_meta.h has the fields of
# ffmpeg-9900-02 (the raw payload of a DM extension block); an FFmpeg whose AVDOVIMetadata is laid out otherwise
# changes every one of those hashes, and only them.
